<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><meta name="color-scheme" content="light"><title>A new week from Watergate Church</title></head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#eaf0ec;color:#24342e;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">
  <div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;color:transparent;">A fresh week, a thoughtful word, and a blessing for the days ahead.</div>
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="background:#eaf0ec;"><tr><td align="center" style="padding:38px 14px;">
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="max-width:580px;background:#fff;">
      <tr><td style="padding:38px 36px 28px;background:#dfe9e1;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd9cf;">
        <p style="margin:0 0 10px;color:#526d5b;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;">A note for your Monday</p>
        <h1 style="margin:0;color:#244832;font:normal 32px/1.2 Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;">A good week begins here.</h1>
      </td></tr>
      <tr><td style="padding:30px 36px 34px;">
        <p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;">Hello {{recipientName}},</p>
        <p style="margin:0 0 18px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;">A new week brings room for fresh beginnings, steady progress, and unexpected joy. May you meet it with courage and grace.</p>
        {{#if weekMessage}}<p style="margin:0 0 22px;padding:16px 18px;background:#f4f7f3;border-left:3px solid #62816b;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;">{{weekMessage}}</p>{{/if}}
        {{#if bibleVerse}}<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="background:#244832;color:#fff;"><tr><td style="padding:22px 24px;"><p style="margin:0;font:italic 19px/1.55 Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;">&ldquo;{{bibleVerse}}&rdquo;</p>{{#if bibleReference}}<p style="margin:14px 0 0;color:#d7e4d9;font:700 12px Arial,sans-serif;">{{bibleReference}}</p>{{/if}}</td></tr></table>{{/if}}
        <p style="margin:24px 0 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;">May the days ahead be fruitful and peaceful. We are keeping you in our thoughts.</p>
      </td></tr>
      <tr><td style="padding:17px 36px;border-top:1px solid #e1e7e1;color:#5b6d60;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;">With care, Watergate Church Global &middot; &copy; {{year}}</td></tr>
    </table>
  </td></tr></table>
</body>
</html>
